1
00:00:00,230 --> 00:00:02,570
(Howard:)The old people just came up
to you, pinched your cheek

2
00:00:02,570 --> 00:00:05,070
(Howard:)and handed you a savings bond.

3
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:07,300
(Raj:)Oh, don't be such gloomy Gusses.

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:10,070
(Raj:)Look at the size
of these shrimp!

5
00:00:10,070 --> 00:00:13,780
(Raj:)At what point do we start
calling them lobsters?

6
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:17,080
(Leonard:)Face it, Raj,
we crashed and burned tonight.

7
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:19,220
(Mrs Latham:)Oh, you didn't
do that badly.

8
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:22,650
(Leonard:)Mrs. Latham, the first machine
I turn on in the morning

9
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:25,190
(Leonard:)is the helium-neon laser,
'cause it needs to warm up.

10
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:27,760
(Mrs Latham:)I no longer care, dear.

11
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:29,260
(Mrs Latham:)But don't worry,

12
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:31,260
(Mrs Latham:)I really enjoyed
meeting you this evening.

13
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:33,230
(Howard:)u're kidding.
That was good for you?

14
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:35,500
'Cause I was sweating
through my T-shirt.

15
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,830
(Mrs Latham:)Excellent! There's
nothing I like better

16
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:40,530
(Mrs Latham:)than making smart people
feel ill at ease.

17
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:42,440
(Leonard:)Why?

18
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:44,640
(Mrs Latham:)Oh, I don't know,
it's one of the fun things

19
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:47,440
(Mrs Latham:)you get to do when
you have lots of money.

20
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:48,880
(Mrs Latham:)Watch.

21
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:51,550
(Mrs Latham:)Hey! Who said you
could eat that shrimp?

22
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:57,080
(Mrs Latham:)See? Fun.

23
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:59,350
(Sheldon(behind them):)No, no, no, I'm just here

24
00:00:59,350 --> 00:01:00,650
(Sheldon(behind them):)for your money.

